*************************************************************
Installation :
wget https://github.com/xutongle/superwebbench/archive/refs/tags/1.0.1.tar.gz
tar zxvf superwebbench-1.0.1.tar.gz
cd superwebbench-1.0.1
./configure && make && make install

The compiler must support C11 atomics, and OpenSSL 1.1 or later is required.
Use ./configure --prefix=/usr/local to select another installation prefix.
For a non-standard OpenSSL installation, set OPENSSL_CFLAGS and OPENSSL_LIBS.

Maintainers can regenerate configure and config.h.in with:
autoreconf -fi

*************************************************************
Question:
ctags is optional and is only used to generate the source index.
The default make target checks for ctags and skips index generation when it is unavailable.
To generate the index, install ctags and run:

make tags

To build only the executable, run:

make superwebbench

To remove build artifacts or all configured files, run:
make clean
make distclean
